{{Further|Blox Fruits}}
Elemental is one of the three classifications of Blox Fruits, alongside [[Natural]] and [[Beast]]. Elemental fruits grant the user powers tied to specific elements, allowing them to manipulate [[Flame|Fire]], [[Ice]], [[Light]], [[Magma]], and other forces of nature. There are currently 11 Elemental fruits in the game.

All Elemental users possess a passive ability called Elemental Reflex, which provides conditional immunity to attacks:

* [[NPCs]] below a certain level cannot damage the user. The required level difference varies depending on the enemy and is fixed per [[NPCs|NPC]].
* Enemies or players with [[Aura]] enabled can always damage the user, regardless of [[level]].
* [[Bosses]] completely bypass Elemental Reflex and can damage the user at all times.


Elemental fruits are especially effective for grinding in the [[First Sea]] and remain strong in the [[Second Sea]], thanks to their immunity and wide-area attacks. Popular choices for farming include [[Light]], [[Magma]], [[Flame]], and [[Ice]] due to their high damage and straightforward movesets. In the [[Third Sea]], however, grinding becomes more difficult: most NPCs use Aura, and the Reflex level requirements increase significantly, reducing the advantage of the passive.

