==Trivia==
* The Level that the player needs for Elemental Reflex to activate is set at about 2% more than their current level.
* [[Smoke]] is the only common Elemental-type fruit.
* [[Smoke]], [[Blizzard]], [[Lightning]] and [[Gas]] are the only elemental fruits without an [[Raids|awakening]], considering that Lightning lost its awakening.
* Elemental is the second largest category of [[Blox Fruits]], ahead of [[Beast]] and behind [[Natural]].
* [[Uncommon]] has the most elemental fruits of every category.
* [[Lightning]] is currently the only fully reworked Elemental fruit.
* [[Lightning]] is also the only upgradable Elemental fruit via the [[Admin Panel]].
* [[Dough]] is notable for being the only fruit based on an man-made substance, rather than a naturally occurring one.
* [[Gas]] is the only Elemental-type fruit that has a [[Transformation]].
* [[Gas]] is the most recent (and currently most expensive) Elemental fruit.
* [[Dough]] is currently the most expensive Elemental fruit to awaken, costing {{Fragment|18,500}} to fully awaken.
* [[Magma]] has the most passive abilities of all Elemental fruits
* Elemental fruits have the most fruits that can deal infinite damage which are [[Smoke]], [[Lightning]] and [[Blizzard]].
* Elemental Fruits have the most fruits that are able to [[Raids|Awaken]] out of any category.
* [[Lightning]] used to have an awakening that was removed and had an old unawakened moveset.

